@startuml 07-save-game-flow
!pragma layout smetana
title Salvataggio - Memento

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class GameModel <<Originator>>
class GameState <<Memento>>
class PlayerSaveState <<Memento>>
class GameSaveService <<Mapper>>
class SaveManager <<JSON Repository>>
class "saves/*.json" as SaveFiles <<asset>>
class CheckpointService <<Service>>
class GameOverService <<Service>>

GameModel --> GameSaveService : save/load
GameSaveService --> GameState : snapshot
GameState *-- PlayerSaveState
GameSaveService --> SaveManager
SaveManager --> SaveFiles
CheckpointService --> GameSaveService : autosave
GameOverService --> GameSaveService : restore

note bottom of GameState
Minimo: GameState è lo snapshot serializzato su JSON.
end note
@enduml
